          "name": "Is HuaSheng a metal furniture manufacturer or an OEM supplier?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Both. HuaSheng designs and manufactures metal furniture and also works as a long-term metal furniture OEM/ODM partner, including IKEA kitchen trolleys, cabinets, shelving, bathroom racks and outdoor metal furniture."
          }
        },
